Package: sg200x-camera-dkms
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Depends: dkms
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Description: camera drivers for Sophgo SG200x boards (DKMS)
 Out-of-tree V4L2 drivers for the SG200x video input (raw capture) and MIPI
 CSI-2 receiver, and for the cameras of the Milk-V Duo S: the Raspberry Pi
 Camera Module 3 (IMX708, DW9817 focus) and Camera Module v1 (OV5647) on J2,
 and the Milk-V CAM-GC2083 on J1. Includes a device tree overlay for each
 camera. Nothing is enabled until an overlay is.
